# Sharing backend (optional). Without these, Chronicle builds and runs exactly
# as it always has: IndexedDB only, no account, no network calls, and the
# Supabase SDK is absent from the bundle entirely.
#
# With them set, the sharing UI appears and the SDK is emitted as a separate
# lazy-loaded chunk that is only fetched once someone signs in.
#
# The anon key is publishable by design — it identifies the project and
# authorises nothing. Row-level security is the gate. Never put a service_role
# key here; it bypasses RLS.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
